# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model) offers new tools for inspecting and customizing error mitigation workflow** &mdash; New tools have been built on top of the directed execution model framework, which was released earlier this year:\n"
msgstr "**[Directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model) menawarkan tools baru untuk memeriksa dan menyesuaikan alur kerja mitigasi error** &mdash; Tools baru telah dibangun di atas kerangka directed execution model yang dirilis awal tahun ini:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Together with [Samplomatic](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/samplomatic/index), they make up the [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model), which provides full transparency and control to fine-tune your error mitigation workflow. The [Probabilistic error cancellation with shaded lightcones](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/tutorials/01_getting_started.html) tutorial, for example, demonstrates how this model is used to combine advanced techniques, including shaded lightcones, probabilistic error cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout Error eXtinction (TREX), and [measurement-based postselection](/guides/post-selection), to further improve the result quality.\n"
"  - [`qiskit-noise-learning`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-noise-learning) is a toolkit for randomization-based quantum noise characterization. You can use it to construct a custom noise-learning experiment, validate it with local simulation, and analyze the raw results.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Bersama dengan [Samplomatic](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/samplomatic/index), keduanya membentuk [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model), yang memberikan transparansi dan kontrol penuh untuk menyempurnakan alur kerja mitigasi error kamu. Tutorial [Probabilistic error cancellation with shaded lightcones](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/tutorials/01_getting_started.html), misalnya, menunjukkan bagaimana model ini digunakan untuk menggabungkan teknik-teknik lanjutan, termasuk shaded lightcones, probabilistic error cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout Error eXtinction (TREX), dan [postselection berbasis pengukuran](/guides/post-selection), untuk lebih meningkatkan kualitas hasil.\n"
"  - [`qiskit-noise-learning`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-noise-learning) adalah toolkit untuk karakterisasi noise kuantum berbasis randomisasi. Kamu bisa memakainya untuk menyusun eksperimen noise-learning khusus, memvalidasinya dengan simulasi lokal, dan menganalisis hasil mentahnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`qiskit-mitigation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-mitigation) is a package of quantum error mitigation methods for building mitigation pipelines with the new execution model. It includes implementations of well-known methods, including PEC, PEA, TREX, and gate-folding ZNE, as well as post-selection for filtering out non-Markovian errors.\n"
msgstr "[`qiskit-mitigation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-mitigation) adalah paket metode mitigasi error kuantum untuk membangun pipeline mitigasi dengan execution model yang baru. Paket ini mencakup implementasi metode-metode terkenal, termasuk PEC, PEA, TREX, dan ZNE berbasis gate-folding, serta post-selection untuk menyaring error non-Markovian.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes#0500-2026-09-24) released **new client-side implementations of Sampler and Estimator** primitives that are built on top of this framework. These implementations allow you to inspect exactly how each error mitigation method is implemented and test them [locally](/guides/local-testing-mode) before running them on an actual QPU. \n"
msgstr "[`qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes#0500-2026-09-24) merilis **implementasi sisi klien yang baru untuk primitif Sampler dan Estimator** yang dibangun di atas kerangka ini. Implementasi ini memungkinkan kamu memeriksa persis bagaimana setiap metode mitigasi error diimplementasikan dan mengujinya [secara lokal](/guides/local-testing-mode) sebelum menjalankannya di QPU sungguhan. \n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    **How to upgrade to the new primitives:** Upgrading to the new primitives is designed to be low-friction, so in most cases, you only need to change your import statements &mdash; not the body of your code. See the [migration guide](/guides/migrate-to-client-side-primitives) for full details.\n"
msgstr "    **Cara upgrade ke primitif baru:** Upgrade ke primitif baru dirancang agar mudah, jadi di sebagian besar kasus kamu hanya perlu mengubah pernyataan import &mdash; bukan isi kodenya. Lihat [panduan migrasi](/guides/migrate-to-client-side-primitives) untuk detail lengkap.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**New skills for agents** &mdash; Whether you are migrating to the new client-side Sampler and Estimator, or migrating old notebooks that still use V1 primitives, the migrate-qiskit-ibm-runtime skill in the [Qiskit/skills](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) repository can simplify the task. This new open-source repository contains official, IBM-verified agent skills for building IBM Quantum and Qiskit workflows. We will be adding more skills to this repository in the near future.\n"
msgstr "**Skills baru untuk agen** &mdash; Baik kamu sedang bermigrasi ke Sampler dan Estimator sisi klien yang baru, maupun memigrasikan notebook lama yang masih memakai primitif V1, skill migrate-qiskit-ibm-runtime di repositori [Qiskit/skills](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) bisa mempermudah tugas ini. Repositori open-source baru ini berisi skill agen resmi yang terverifikasi IBM untuk membangun alur kerja IBM Quantum dan Qiskit. Kami akan menambahkan lebih banyak skill ke repositori ini dalam waktu dekat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lastly, check out the [PEC with logical noise models tutorial](/tutorials/probabilistic-error-cancellation-with-logical-noise-models) for an example of stacking error detection and mitigation methods using these new tools.\n"
msgstr "Terakhir, lihat [tutorial PEC with logical noise models](/tutorials/probabilistic-error-cancellation-with-logical-noise-models) untuk contoh penumpukan metode deteksi dan mitigasi error memakai tools baru ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  The directed execution model, comprised of [Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/) and [Executor](/guides/get-started-with-executor), exposes the error mitigation logic applied to your workloads so that you have full control over the logic without sacrificing performance.\n"
msgstr "  Directed execution model, yang terdiri dari [Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/) dan [Executor](/guides/get-started-with-executor), membuka logika mitigasi error yang diterapkan pada beban kerja kamu sehingga kamu punya kontrol penuh atas logika tersebut tanpa mengorbankan performa.\n"

